#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/with-word.md:8
msgid "Sometimes a `with` is just a `with`."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/with-word.md:10
